<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="92a4cf72">&lt;h3&gt;
    Collection Lessons Learned
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Lessons learned are collected throughout a project and formally documented during the Closing process. It is the
    responsibility of each project manager to&amp;nbsp;share the lessons learned.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Applying lessons learned (learning and knowledge from previous projects) leads to more effective projects. Before
    beginning any project, lessons learned should be reviewed so that a project team:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Can benefit from prior successes.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Learn which situations to avoid.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Find suggestions for handling challenges.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Those lessons learned that summarize what works well and which should be considered on future projects are identified
    as recommended practices.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    The Lessons Learned that are documented in Lessons Learned Template. Solicit project team members for input regarding
    beneficial measures taken, feedback to improve efficiency and proactive strategies to avoid issues that arose during
    the project. Consolidate this input and use it during a team meeting to discuss Lessons Learned and brainstorm new
    ideas.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;
    Lessons learned considerations
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Analyze lessons learned with the goal of maximizing what worked well and leveraging improvements for future projects.
    The key questions to focus on for each area are indicated below.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table title=&quot;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; width=&quot;85%&quot; border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
    &lt;tbody&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Key questions
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                1) What worked well and why?&lt;br /&gt;
                2) What did not work well and why?&lt;br /&gt;
                3) How could the team do better next time?
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;table title=&quot;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; width=&quot;85%&quot; border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
    &lt;tbody&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; abbr=&quot;&quot;&gt;
                Project process
            &lt;/th&gt;
            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; abbr=&quot;&quot;&gt;
                Lessons learned considerations
            &lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Initiate
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Initial planning
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Defining service quality&lt;br /&gt;
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Plan
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Confirming client requirements
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Conducting detailed planning
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Team and stakeholder communication
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        EY resource and stakeholder availability
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Developing the project charter&lt;br /&gt;
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Execute
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Launching the project
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Executing the work plan and creating work products/reports
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Monitoring, controlling and reporting progress
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Reviewing and approving work products/reports
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Obtaining feedback from stakeholders on work products
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Finalizing project documentation
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Performance to budget
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Teaming, EY resources, client commitment, Subject Matter Resource involvement
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Risk Management 
                        &lt;ul&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Identification
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Tracking
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Resolution
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                        &lt;/ul&gt;
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Issues management 
                        &lt;ul&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Identification
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Tracking
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Resolution
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                        &lt;/ul&gt;
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Documentation
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Change control 
                        &lt;ul&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Actual work effort/detail vs. expected work detail vs. required detail
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Variances to work plan
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                        &lt;/ul&gt;
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Resource management 
                        &lt;ul&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Effective utilization
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Attainment of performance goals
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Coaching and mentoring
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                        &lt;/ul&gt;
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Monitor and control&lt;br /&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Quality management
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Control management 
                        &lt;ul&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Identification
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Impact assessment
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Implementation
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                        &lt;/ul&gt;
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Risk management
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li style=&quot;LIST-STYLE-TYPE: none&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;ul&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Identification
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Tracking
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                            &lt;li&gt;
                                Resolution
                            &lt;/li&gt;
                        &lt;/ul&gt;
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Status reporting
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Close
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Feedback following quality reviews
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Assessing team members performance
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Submitting knowledge
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Retaining and archiving project documentation
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;</attribute>
